  m_Name: LivingRoom_HarukoKatsuko
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko have returned from their day out together.)
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c04eb80f54b963c4688e8c562474dedd, type: 3}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (.....................)
    - (That's a rather unflattering position.)
    - (Some things never change, huh? Katsuko's still clinging to her big sister...
      Even though they were only born less than an hour apart.)
    - (The triplets were always together since they were infants. They were inseparable
      in school.)
    - (But since Mitsuko's not as social as they are, I think they've formed an even
      tighter bond with each other.)
    - (As they got older, it became just the two of them playing together while Mitsuko
      indulged in her interest in books.)
    - (Although... Now that Mitsuko has friends of her own, it looks like they only
      have each other while Mitsuko's with her own people.)
    - (I suppose it is nice seeing them still close with each other.)
  alternateSequences: []
